# Ignore policy for the AgenticEngineer archive.
#
# The rule of thumb: this repo tracks *source and prose*, never *bytes we can
# re-download or re-generate*. The 22 GB of lesson video is deliberately not in
# git — see docs/adr/0002-media-is-ignored-not-tracked.md. media/MANIFEST.md is
# tracked instead, so the ignored tree stays auditable.

# --- OS / editor -------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/

# --- JavaScript --------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.next/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Media bytes (~22 GB) ----------------------------------------------------
# Ignored by EXTENSION rather than by directory. Excluding `media/raw/` wholesale
# would be unrecoverable: git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is
# excluded, so the *-sync.json sidecars the recorder validation reads — and
# media/MANIFEST.md itself — would be silently dropped. Extension rules ignore
# every byte while leaving the .json/.md metadata tracked with no negation games.
*.mp4
*.m4a
*.mov
*.webm
*.aac

# Recorder frame captures: 5,286 files / 1.2 GB of contact sheets, preflight
# frames and per-frame stills. Scoped to media/raw/ on purpose — catalog/ holds
# ~400 legitimate tracked thumbnails and course-page images.
media/raw/**/*.jpg
media/raw/**/*.jpeg
media/raw/**/*.png

# --- Model weights -----------------------------------------------------------
# The leading **/ is load-bearing: these live at
# codebases/ah/multi-agent-orchestration/asset/, not at the repo root.
**/asset/*.safetensors
**/asset/gpt/
**/asset/tokenizer/

# --- Agent scratch -----------------------------------------------------------
.claude/worktrees/
worktrees/

# --- Run logs ----------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
**/_weekly_run_*.json
**/_batch_summary_*.json
# _weekly_last_run.json is the idempotency state tools/youtube/weekly_update.py
# reads on every run — it must stay tracked.
!**/_weekly_last_run.json
